    displayRows,
    'The standard "API_SUPPLIERQUOTATION_SRV" name is not deployed in this landscape (HTTP 403) \u2014 MM_PUR_RFQ_MAINTAIN_SRV/C_SupplierQuotationFacet (real bidder-submitted quotation data attached to each RFQ) is the genuine live equivalent.'
